As AI systems become more autonomous and decentralized, traditional models of control are no longer sufficient. **Phronesis Cyber Physics™** introduces a way to govern digital intelligence without authoritarian constraint—by **baking governance into functionality**, ethics into logic, and purpose into data flow.

